    "title": "Scores Widget",
    "description": "Scores Widget is a hobby project of mine that was designed to be a non-intrusive way to get real-time score updates for your favorite teams right on your home screen and watch. It also supports speech so you can get updates without looking at your phone.\r\n \r\n WEAR OS\r\n- Wear OS app has been created and supports newer devices.\r\n- It is completely independent which means no phone or companion app is needed.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER:\r\nScores Widget is NOT affiliated with, endorsed, or sponsored by any of the sports teams or leagues used within the app.",
